Package: ggmapcn
Title: Customizable China and Global Map Visualizations
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Liang", "Ren", email = "rl23@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2360-7900"))
Description: Provides 'ggplot2' layers and annotations for thematic mapping
    of China and the world. Uses administrative division data from the
    'Tianditu' geospatial information service and separate layers for land
    borders, coastlines, and maritime boundaries. Supports province-,
    city-, and county-level maps, map projections, graticules, scale bars,
    north arrows, boundary buffers, and elevation and vegetation raster
    layers. The package provides default map datasets. Larger data files are
    hosted in a companion repository
    <https://github.com/Rimagination/ggmapcn-data> and retrieved as needed.
License: GPL-3
